TITLE Sepiolite(d) SI for Ba solution with mineral assemblage at 100C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ba 100
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Talc 0 10
    Rhodochrosite 0 10
    Sepiolite 0 10
    Sepiolite(d) 0 10
    Pb(OH)2 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -si Sepiolite(d)
END
